# Docs are ignored by default — working notes, milestone specs, and reviews stay
# local. The durable contracts below are the exception: they are committed
# because source comments and onboarding cite them, so they must exist in a
# fresh clone.
docs/*
!docs/system-contract.md
!docs/testing.md
!docs/decisions/
!docs/decisions/**
